Subject: Add bounded native THP decoder entry points

Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

Keep the SDK signatures and valid arithmetic shared. Bound header/entropy
reads and output planes, check malformed DC accumulation before signed overflow,
and validate complete audio channels before entering the actual PCM decoder.

diff --git a/include/dolphin/thp.h b/include/dolphin/thp.h
